Industrializing Society

[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_SOCIETY_desc]
The rumors about “Illegal Mining” is a complete lie. We just picked up a few, perhaps a few thousand, small rocks from the roadside. We are not guilty of anything.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_SOCIETY]
工业化社会

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_SOCIETY_desc]
关于“非法采矿”的传言完全是谎言。我们只是从路边捡了几块，也许是几千块小石头。我们没有做错任何事。

